{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Pumpkin Patch Simulator!<br><br>Pumpkin Patch Simulator is a first-person cozy farming sim about growing your own pumpkins.<br><br>Use your seeds to plant pumpkins, so that you can harvest them and unlock the ability to buy higher ranked seeds.<br><br>Higher ranked seeds will grow bigger pumpkins.<br><br>Oh, and also you can use the money that you earn from harvesting pumpkins in the fun shop! Decorate your land with spooky halloween themed decor, or sip upon a pumpkin spice latte (some pumpkins were harmed in the making of the latte).<br><br>Yep, that's pretty much about it. <br><br>Grow the biggest pumpkin today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068630?t=1761199365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068630?t=1761199365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068630/5093c8b0241d5b80ebfa586dfa7e752c0ea597cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761199365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068630/5093c8b0241d5b80ebfa586dfa7e752c0ea597cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761199365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Pumpkin Patch Simulator!<br><br>Pumpkin Patch Simulator is a first-person cozy farming sim about growing your own pumpkins.<br><br>Use your seeds to plant pumpkins, so that you can harvest them and unlock the ability to buy higher ranked seeds.<br><br>Higher ranked seeds will grow bigger pumpkins.<br><br>Oh, and also you can use the money that you earn from harvesting pumpkins in the fun shop! Decorate your land with spooky halloween themed decor, or sip upon a pumpkin spice latte (some pumpkins were harme